  "prefLabel": "He-M 316.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-M 316.01 Purpose. The purpose of this rule is to establish fees in order to offset departmental costs of providing assistance to the committee for the protection of human subjects (CPHS).\n\nSource. #9588, eff 11-4-09; ss by #12408, INTERIM, eff 10-24-17, EXPIRES: 4-22-18",
